BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville Runners
UID:event_314079586@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260421T140136Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260421T181500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260421T201500
SUMMARY:Tuesday Brewsday High Wire Big Top
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Runners\nWelcome to a route full of hills and thrill
 s! This run takes us through the beautiful Kenilworth neighborhood. The 3 
 mile and 5 mile routes are as follows:\n\n3.13 Mile Hi-Wire Big Top Meadow
  Rd\, L Biltmore (aer you cross)\, R Kenilwood Pl\, Stay L Kenilwood/Fi
 nalee\, R Caledonia Rd\,L Pickwick Rd\, Straight on Kenilworth Rd\, R Chil
 es Ave\, L Lakewood Pkwy\,R Lakewood Dr\, L Waverly Rd\, L Kenilworth Rd\,
  R Warwick Rd\, R Forest Hill Dr\, L Castle St\, R Caledonia Rd\, L Biltmo
 re Ave\, R Meadow Rd\, R huntsman place.\n\n5.10 Mile Hi-Wire Big TopL Mea
 dow Rd\, L Biltmore (aer you cross)\,R Unadilla Ave\, Stay L on Unadill
 a AveL Castle Street\, L Forest Hill DrR Wyoming Rd\, Straight Lakewood Dr
 \, R Lakewood Dr\, Stay on Lakewood Dr\,R Plymouth Cir\, R Duke St\, R Ken
 ilworth Rd\,L Faulkner Ave\, Straight McClain St\,R Warwick Rd\, L Forest 
 Hill Dr\, R Caledonia Rd\, Immediate L Caledonia Rd\, L Kenilworth Rd\, R 
 Kenilworth Rd\, Straight/L Pickwick Rd\, R Caledonia Rd\, L Bowling Park R
 d\, L Caledonia Rd\, L Biltmore Rd\, R Meadow Rd\, R Huntsman Pl
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-runners/events/314079586/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260401T230748Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260401T230748Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Asheville Runners
UID:event_312835123@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260421T140136Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260423T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260423T200000
SUMMARY:Thursday Run 
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Runners\nCome run 1\, 3\, or 6 miles and stay for a 
 beer and soccer tennis after at Olde London Road.\n\nRoutes-\n1 miler:\nRI
 GHT out of OLR parking lot\nContinue around roundabout at Clingman\, and h
 ead toward the river on Lyman St.\nRIGHT on River Arts Place\nCross Rivers
 ide onto the Greenway\nRight on the Greenway to the Craven St Park put in 
 (the dock)\nTurn around and go back the same way to OLR\n\n3 miler:\nStart
  the same as 1 miler\nContinue onto Craven St. Bridge\nLEFT onto Greenway 
 after bridge\nFollow Greenway all the way until it ends at Haywood Rd.\nRI
 GHT onto Haywood Rd\, go across the bridge\nCross the Roundabout at Robert
 s St. and continue onto Clingman\nContinue on Clingman\nLEFT onto Owens Be
 ll Lane\nLEFT onto Hilliard at the top of the hill\nLEFT onto W Haywood\, 
 follow all the way down to Roberts\nLEFT onto Roberts\nFollow Roberts back
  to OLR\nPass OLR to Bartlett\, turn around and come back to OLR\n\n6 mile
 r:\nAfter the W Haywood downhill to Roberts\nLEFT onto Roberts St. take to
  Lyman and head back to the Greenway\nLEFT onto the Greenway\, take all th
 e way to Amboy\nRIGHT on Amboy to cross the bridge\nRIGHT into French Broa
 d River Park\, run the loop at the park\nCross back over the bridge on Amb
 oy and run the Greenway back to the roundabout\nFollow Lyman back to OLR
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/asheville-runners/events/312835123/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260111T194411Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260111T194411Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
